## AI Agents & Skills

- [CircleCI Skills Repository](https://github.com/CircleCI-Public/skills): CircleCI-managed agent plugins: `circleci`, skills for building, debugging, and optimizing pipelines, and `chunk`, skills for CircleCI Chunk. Installs in Claude Code, Codex, or any agent that reads SKILL.md.
- [MCP Server](https://circleci.com/product/mcp/): CircleCI's Model Context Protocol server, which lets AI agents diagnose failing builds, trace failures to recent changes, and spot flaky tests. Built into the CircleCI CLI for local editors, or hosted with OAuth for web-based agents.
